1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,671
Silver going dark again?

2
00:00:02,124 --> 00:00:04,236
Put a piece of chalk in the pouch.

3
00:00:04,433 --> 00:00:08,298
Tarnish returns fastest when silver meets
air and moisture.

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,474
Store each piece in a soft pouch, or

5
00:00:11,484 --> 00:00:13,747
a zip bag with the air pressed out,

6
00:00:13,875 --> 00:00:17,195
and add a small piece of chalk to absorb
moisture.

7
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:20,243
The full seven-step guide is on the
channel.
